# Haxe oracle of the view-lifetime contract. The runner passes -js with the
# per-attempt output file; Bun executes the generated JS. It compiles the same
# case sources as the Swift generation and prints one labeled line per case;
# the native Swift run must print the identical labeled lines.
-lib boring
-cp packages/compiler
-cp samples
-cp tests/haxe/view-lifetime-contract
--macro Intercept.run(['samples', 'tests/haxe/view-lifetime-contract'])
-main ViewLifetimeOracle
